      "description": "Expert Emergency and Specialty Care for Pets in Southeast Michigan  MedVet Commerce is a premier animal emergency and specialty hospital serving Southeast Michigan. Our highly trained team serves as an extension of your family veterinarian’s care. Serving more than 10,000 patients a year, our team is the trusted choice for family veterinarians and pet lovers. We know pets are an important part of your family, and we strive to provide exceptional care while showing you and your pet compassion. Our team has the expertise to skillfully deal with any pet emergency and provide advanced specialty care for your pet with the goal of getting your pet home to you in the best health. If your pet is facing an emergency, you can come directly to our hospital – no appointment is needed.",
